      "DocumentDetail": {
        "description": "PRD \u00a76.5 \u2014 the summary plus the original content.\n\nProvenance (AD-014) is on this model and not on the summary: `ingested_by_key_id`\nand `ingested_from_ip` answer a forensic question about one document, and\nrepeating them down a fifty-row listing invites reading the listing as an\naudit trail. The trail is `kb_audit.request_logs`.",
        "examples": [
          {
            "chunk_count": 14,
            "collection": "kb__openai__text_embedding_3_small__1536__c1",
            "content_hash": "9f2c...",
            "created_at": "2026-07-30T09:12:44Z",
            "id": "3f2504e0-4f89-41d3-9a0c-0305e82c3301",
            "source": "redshift_architecture.md",
